            "text": "[SYSTEM REPORT] Shared Report: Менеджер used shell_exec. Output: STDOUT:\ndiff --git a/swarm/cli.py b/swarm/cli.py\nindex 79b7f5f..f605737 100644\n--- a/swarm/cli.py\n+++ b/swarm/cli.py\n@@ -61,7 +61,10 @@ def run():\n   ...",
